            "question": "I have never designed anything. Is that a problem?",
            "answer": "<p>No. The course starts with the brand kit and the basics of layout, and most students have never opened a design app before.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long until I make something?",
            "answer": "<p>The brand kit is the end of module one. With two hours a week, most people have it in the first week and a poster in the second.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I follow along on a tablet?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The lessons are recorded on a laptop, and a short lesson shows where things are in the tablet and phone apps.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use the templates for clients?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, for your own business and for client work. You cannot resell the templates themselves as templates.</p>"
